                                        "entry_id": "b005b19d-9c53-32cf-b033-0ee0dbea7936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A channel for conveying water or other farm liquids (such as milk) from place to place by gravity; any ‘U’ or ‘V’ cross-sectioned irrigation channel."
                                        ],
